<title>VIETNAM: Vietnam Jan-Apr industrial output up yr-yr 13.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Vietnam Jan-Apr industrial output up yr-yr 13.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HANOI 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vietnam's industrial production in the first four months of this year was 13.8 percent higher than in the same period of 1996, the General Statistics Office said on Monday.</p>
<p>Output by state-owned enterprises rose 11.6 percent, non-state sector output was up 10.6 percent and the foreign-invested sector's output was up 21.9 percent.</p>
</text>
